Adapt ncli to the differential testing workflow.

`transition` now passes skipBlockSignatureValidation (added by 0001) alongside
skipStateRootValidation when --verify-state-root is off, which is the
validate_result = false shape the other clients run under. Signature checks
other than the proposer's stay on.

sanity-slots, operation and epoch-processing are added because `transition`
alone leaves the sanity_slots, operations and epoch_processing suites of
consensus-spec-tests unreachable. Each takes its pre-state, its input and an
output path as positional arguments, and writes the post state out for
comparison.
